version       0.1.0
distribution  public
source        "ROS 2 interface package mavros_msgs, https://github.com/mavlink/mavros ros2 (BSD License, GPLv3 or LGPLv3 (triple licensed)) at commit 3e580649f4b6344d428796711694fd7f0a6f31ff, directory mavros_msgs/msg; field names, types and array forms only"
